<title>ESTONIA: EVEA PANK PROFIT SLIGHTLY UP IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>EVEA PANK PROFIT SLIGHTLY UP IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEA Pank had a profit of 1.3 million kroons in April compared to a 1.1 million kroons in March, the bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>EVEA Pank's profit so far this year is 4.6 million kroons this year, the bank added in a statement.</p>
<p>EVEA Pank assets were at 486.5 million kroons compared to 482 million kroons a month ago.</p>
<p>The loan portfolio was at 235.6 million kroons compared to 227 million kroons in March. Deposits were at 350 million kroons versus 359 million kroons in March.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
